==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Fleet-Lotus Seeds}}
Fleet-Lotus Seeds can be found growing in wetlands across [[Hyrule]], such as near the [[Ne'ez Yohma Shrine]] and throughout the [[Lanayru Wetlands]]. [[Stamm]], a [[Wandering Merchant]], sells them for 20 [[Rupee]]s. They restore half of a [[Heart]] for [[Link]] when eaten. They can also be [[Cooking|Cooked]] into [[Meal]]s to grant Link [[Speed Up]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> When they are burned by [[Fire]], they turn into [[Roasted Lotus Seeds]]. At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], they can be used to make Green [[Dye]].

